{
  "name": "Ringkasan Penjualan Harian — Google Sheets ke Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP (10 menit)\n\n1. **Sheet Anda** harus punya kolom `Tanggal` berformat `YYYY-MM-DD` (mis. `2026-09-27`) dan kolom `Total` berisi angka.\n   Tips: isi kolom Tanggal dengan rumus `=TEXT(TODAY(),\"yyyy-mm-dd\")` supaya formatnya otomatis benar.\n2. **Google Sheets**: sambungkan kredensial Google Anda, pilih spreadsheet dan sheet tempat Anda mencatat order.\n3. **Telegram**: buat bot lewat @BotFather, salin Bot Token-nya ke kredensial node Telegram, lalu ambil Chat ID lewat `https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates`.\n4. Sesuaikan jam kirim di node jadwal (default 21:00).\n\nLalu AKTIFKAN workflow (toggle di kanan atas).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "nota-setup",
      "name": "Catatan Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 21
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-schedule",
      "name": "Setiap Jam 9 Malam",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "GANTI_DENGAN_ID_SPREADSHEET_ANDA"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "GANTI_DENGAN_NAMA_SHEET_ATAU_GID"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "read-sheet",
      "name": "Baca Semua Baris",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [240, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "combinator": "and",
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Tanggal }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-today",
      "name": "Hanya Hari Ini",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [480, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldsToSummarize": {
          "values": [
            {
              "aggregation": "sum",
              "field": "Total"
            },
            {
              "aggregation": "count",
              "field": "Total"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "summarize-total",
      "name": "Jumlahkan Total",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.summarize",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [720, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "GANTI_DENGAN_CHAT_ID_ANDA",
        "text": "=📊 Ringkasan Penjualan Hari Ini ({{ $now.format('dd-MM-yyyy') }})\n\nJumlah order: {{$json[\"count_Total\"]}}\nTotal penjualan: Rp{{$json[\"sum_Total\"]}}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "send-telegram",
      "name": "Kirim Ringkasan Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [960, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Setiap Jam 9 Malam": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Baca Semua Baris",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Baca Semua Baris": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Hanya Hari Ini",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Hanya Hari Ini": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Jumlahkan Total",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Jumlahkan Total": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Kirim Ringkasan Telegram",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
